WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:04.520
And now here we're going to cover the second type of projects where we're going to use our basic SQL

00:04.520 --> 00:09.560
skills in order to do something called data profiling, where we're going to try to understand all the

00:09.560 --> 00:14.280
aspects of our data sets using simple aggregations like the sum average count.

00:14.320 --> 00:17.040
And as well we will be using techniques like subqueries.
